    "title": "chore: remove Drips Wave references, add launch checklist and docs link",
    "body": "Makes the project independent of the Drips Wave program.\n\n- **Remove Drips Wave program artifacts** — drops the \"funded by Drips Wave 7\" claim from the README (the project is not funded by the program) and deletes the program-specific docs: `submission.md`, `submission_checklist.md`, `audit_and_roadmap.md`, `github_publish_steps.md`, and the master prompt PDF. All were stale; every actionable step in them has been verified complete against the live repo.\n- **Add `launch_checklist.md`** — a program-neutral checklist of the remaining v0.1.x launch work (demo video, optional crates.io publish), with the already-done items recorded as verified on 2026-07-14.\n- **Link the GitBook docs site from the README header** — the canonical documentation lives at https://tollcraft.gitbook.io/docs; the README previously only linked individual lint pages.",
